(7034551, 1068572, 28261, '<td valign="top">This image screams at me, "I am a 10!", however the reflection is so pronounced that I cannot get beyond to see the 10 inside the cabin.  This is the only image I feel bad about scoring because it is my expectation of what the image should focus on that is causing my inability to see your point of view.  Bumping to a 7 because I know it is a great image that suffers only from the viewer''s double vision.</td>', 'This image screams at me, "I am a 10!", however the reflection is so pronounced that I cannot get beyond to see the 10 inside the cabin.  This is the only image I feel bad about scoring because it is my expectation of what the image should focus on that is causing my inability to see your point of view.  Bumping to a 7 because I know it is a great image that suffers only from the viewer''s double vision.', '2013-05-08 15:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
