(7035640, 1068241, 59737, '<td valign="top">Cool, nice range of tone and color, love the pop of green with the plug and how it all fades to black at the bottom, a tighter crop with less of the cord would have worked better for me.</td>', 'Cool, nice range of tone and color, love the pop of green with the plug and how it all fades to black at the bottom, a tighter crop with less of the cord would have worked better for me.', '2013-05-10 21:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
