(7036919, 1068251, 112828, '<td valign="top">Too cool!<br/> <br/>Love the processing and treatment of the image, even the border really works well here, and that blue is perfect.<br/> <br/>The biggest issue I have is the shallow DOF.  There''s just not quite enough in focus here for my tastes, but it''s damned good anyway!</td>', 'Too cool! Love the processing and treatment of the image, even the border really works well here, and that blue is perfect. The biggest issue I have is the shallow DOF.  There''s just not quite enough in focus here for my tastes, but it''s damned good anyway!', '2013-05-14 17:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
