(7037407, 1068652, 92953, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Judi:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t like the effect you have used on this. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Judi, sorry no offence mean, your critiques doesn''t work for me. I shall most be grateful if you make sure your critique is useful.<br/> <br/>Example of simple praise "nice photo" or condemnation "I don''t like the effect" will not help a person to improve their image. <br/>Please make sure you use the WHAT, WHY, HOW approach:<br/> <br/>a) WHAT you like or dislike about the image<br/> <br/>b) WHY you would change it<br/> <br/>c) HOW you would make improvements to the image<br/> <br/>Thanks<br/> <br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Judi: I don''t like the effect you have used on this.   Hi Judi, sorry no offence mean, your critiques doesn''t work for me. I shall most be grateful if you make sure your critique is useful. Example of simple praise "nice photo" or condemnation "I don''t like the effect" will not help a person to improve their image. Please make sure you use the WHAT, WHY, HOW approach: a) WHAT you like or dislike about the image b) WHY you would change it c) HOW you would make improvements to the image Thanks ', '2013-05-15 08:51:12.000000', NULL, 0),
